1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:03,321
How to make your own custom mini you, from your own photo.

2
00:00:04,221 --> 00:00:09,338
This figurine started as one phone photo. Here's exactly how we make it, in four steps.

3
00:00:10,238 --> 00:00:15,790
Step one. We upload the photo to Chat G P T, and ask for a semi-realistic 3D design.

4
00:00:16,690 --> 00:00:23,536
Not right the first time? Just ask for changes. We asked: make her standing. And remove the ball in her hand.

5
00:00:24,436 --> 00:00:28,376
Same face. Same dress. Same little bow. Just cuter.

6
00:00:29,276 --> 00:00:34,474
Step two. We give that design to Tripo 3D, and it builds a full 3D model.

7
00:00:35,374 --> 00:00:42,837
The colours aren't perfect yet. So, step three. In the slicer, we paint the parts it missed, like the eyes.

8
00:00:43,737 --> 00:00:49,516
Step four. The Snapmaker U one prints it. Eleven hours. Nine hundred and fifty colour changes.

9
00:00:50,416 --> 00:00:53,173
Then the supports come off, and we sand it by hand.

10
00:00:54,073 --> 00:00:54,952
And here's the result.

11
00:00:55,852 --> 00:01:01,019
Want to make your own mini you 3D figurine? Send us one photo on WhatsApp, and we'll make it for you.

12
00:01:01,919 --> 00:01:06,457
Or make it yourself. Comment 3D, to get the full prompt and guide in your DM.

